{
  "uid": "conta-ledger",
  "title": "Conta Digital: ledger",
  "description": "Serviço ledger (Fase 1): RED do gRPC, métricas de negócio, banco e pool de conexões (USE), logs e traces. Provisionado como código: edite o JSON, não a interface.",
  "tags": ["conta-digital", "ledger", "fase-1"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": { "from": "now-30m", "to": "now" },
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1, "type": "row", "title": "gRPC (RED)", "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": 2, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Taxa por método",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (rpc_method) (rate(rpc_server_call_duration_seconds_count{job=\"ledger\",rpc_method=~\"conta.ledger.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{rpc_method}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 3, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Falhas do servidor (% das chamadas)",
      "description": "Só falhas do servidor (UNKNOWN, DEADLINE_EXCEEDED, INTERNAL, UNAVAILABLE, DATA_LOSS). Recusas de negócio (FAILED_PRECONDITION, NOT_FOUND, ALREADY_EXISTS) e pedidos inválidos estão no painel de negócio.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(rpc_server_call_duration_seconds_count{job=\"ledger\",rpc_method=~\"conta.ledger.*\",rpc_response_status_code=~\"UNKNOWN|DEADLINE_EXCEEDED|INTERNAL|UNAVAILABLE|DATA_LOSS\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) / sum(rate(rpc_server_call_duration_seconds_count{job=\"ledger\",rpc_method=~\"conta.ledger.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "falhas" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent", "min": 0, "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 4, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Latência p99 por método",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, rpc_method) (rate(rpc_server_call_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"ledger\",rpc_method=~\"conta.ledger.*\"}[$__rate_interval])))", "legendFormat": "{{rpc_method}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 5 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },

    {
      "id": 10, "type": "row", "title": "Negócio", "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 9 }
    },
    {
      "id": 11, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Lançamentos por minuto",
      "description": "Lançamentos gravados (executados agora), por operação e motivo. Repetições idempotentes não contam.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "60 * sum by (ledger_operation, ledger_reason) (rate(ledger_entries_total{job=\"ledger\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{ledger_operation}} {{ledger_reason}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 12, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Valor movimentado por minuto",
      "description": "Soma dos valores lançados, convertida de centavos para reais só na exibição.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 10 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "60 * sum by (ledger_operation) (rate(ledger_posted_amount_total{job=\"ledger\"}[$__rate_interval])) / 100", "legendFormat": "{{ledger_operation}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "currencyBRL", "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 13, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Recusas de negócio",
      "description": "Escritas recusadas e gravadas com a chave: saldo insuficiente, conta inexistente, CPF já cadastrado.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 10 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (ledger_operation, ledger_rejection) (rate(ledger_rejections_total{job=\"ledger\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{ledger_operation}} {{ledger_rejection}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 14, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Idempotência e contenção",
      "description": "Repetições: retries respondidos com o resultado gravado (esperado). Conflitos: mesma chave com outro pedido (bug do cliente). Conta ocupada: UNAVAILABLE por lock_timeout (contenção na conta quente).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 10 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (ledger_operation) (rate(ledger_idempotency_replays_total{job=\"ledger\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "repetições {{ledger_operation}}" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "sum by (ledger_operation) (rate(ledger_idempotency_conflicts_total{job=\"ledger\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "conflitos {{ledger_operation}}" },
        { "refId": "C", "expr": "sum by (rpc_method) (rate(rpc_server_call_duration_seconds_count{job=\"ledger\",rpc_response_status_code=\"UNAVAILABLE\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "conta ocupada {{rpc_method}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },

    {
      "id": 20, "type": "row", "title": "Banco e pool de conexões (USE)", "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 18 }
    },
    {
      "id": 21, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Utilização do pool",
      "description": "U do método USE: conexões em uso / máximo do pool (LEDGER_DB_MAX_CONNS).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 19 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "100 * sum by (instance) (pgxpool_acquired_connections{job=\"ledger\"}) / sum by (instance) (pgxpool_max_connections{job=\"ledger\"})", "legendFormat": "{{instance}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percent", "min": 0, "max": 100, "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 22, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Saturação: espera por conexão",
      "description": "S do método USE: segundos esperados por segundo porque o pool estava vazio. Acima de zero de forma sustentada, o pool é o gargalo.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 19 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (instance) (rate(pgxpool_empty_acquire_wait_time_nanoseconds_total{job=\"ledger\"}[$__rate_interval])) / 1e9", "legendFormat": "espera {{instance}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "min": 0, "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 23, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Erros: aquisições canceladas",
      "description": "E do método USE: pedidos de conexão abandonados (prazo da chamada esgotado esperando o pool).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 19 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (instance) (rate(pgxpool_canceled_acquires_total{job=\"ledger\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{instance}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "min": 0, "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 24, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Latência p99 no banco",
      "description": "Duração das operações no Postgres medida pelo cliente (otelpgx), por tipo.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 19 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, pgx_operation_type) (rate(db_client_operation_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"ledger\"}[$__rate_interval])))", "legendFormat": "{{pgx_operation_type}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 5 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },

    {
      "id": 30, "type": "row", "title": "Logs e traces", "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 27 }
    },
    {
      "id": 31, "type": "logs", "title": "Logs do ledger",
      "description": "Um log por chamada gRPC; erros internos trazem a causa. O campo trace_id vira link para o trace no Tempo.",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 28 },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "expr": "{service_name=\"ledger\"}", "queryType": "range" }],
      "options": { "showTime": true, "wrapLogMessage": true, "sortOrder": "Descending", "enableLogDetails": true }
    },
    {
      "id": 32, "type": "table", "title": "Traces de escrita recentes",
      "description": "Chamadas de escrita do ledger; o trace mostra as queries do Postgres como filhas e os atributos ledger.outcome e ledger.account_id.",
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 28 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "queryType": "traceql", "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"ledger\" && span.ledger.outcome != nil }", "limit": 20, "tableType": "traces" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
